        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "푹신푹신한 털은 전기를\n모으기 쉽지만 고무 같은 피부\n덕분에 자신은 마비되지 않는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa douce laine stocke facilement l’électricité.\nSa peau caoutchouteuse prévient l’électrocution.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein flauschiges Fell speichert Elektrizität.\nSeine Gummihaut schützt es vor Stromstößen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su esponjosa lana almacena electricidad. Su piel\ngomosa evita que sea electrocutado.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La soffice pelliccia raccoglie elettricità. Non resta\nfulminato grazie a uno strato di pelle gommosa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its fluffy fleece easily stores electricity. Its rubbery\nhide keeps it from being electrocuted.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
